        <div class="tldr">
          <ul class="list-none p-0 m-0 space-y-1">
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">Networks beat individual hiring on speed, variety, and redundancy</li>
            <li class="text-[14px] text-ink-2 before:content-['—_'] before:text-accent before:font-semibold">OKAD manages 700+ creators: matching, briefing, QC, payouts</li>
